      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "授業中、ちょっとしたことで負傷してしまった僕は、\n手当をしてもらおうと学園の保健室に向かった――はずなのだが。",
      "jp_sha256": "6611b1959f1106bab66034b5024edba6e7866004d7e770fc6b9554f592897127",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "수업 중 사소한 일로 다친 나는,\n치료를 받으려고 학원 보건실로 향했다――고 생각했는데.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 8,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b622e3f5cd140a37464df873e81c104f067224c42727727932e9a1e631fb9f1c:000002_68175285134775903:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "授業中、ちょっとしたことで負傷してしまった僕は、\n手当をしてもらおうと学園の保健室に向かった――はずなのだが。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "f6b6a0de726361dcb41c3bf548ed34297f9663365d8000b6d470425df6ddd9e5",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ふふ……先生。\nそれで、どこが大きくなってしまったのですか？",
      "jp_sha256": "0e9a3777fcc625e80198d4bdf3f91a3d1e0da0c802024e047371d933ac7f2bd6",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "후후…… 선생님.\n그래서 어디가 커져 버린 건가요?",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b622e3f5cd140a37464df873e81c104f067224c42727727932e9a1e631fb9f1c:000002_68175285134775903:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ヴァリナ保険医",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "ふふ……先生。\nそれで、どこが大きくなってしまったのですか？",
        "",
        "ch_66040/R18/66040A0_66040_Nml/66040A0_66040_001",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ヴァリナ保険医",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_66040/R18/66040A0_66040_Nml/66040A0_66040_001"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "825186c8f8fc78a56e08004ebb96605653353fe769a750d1c45fd46893a4f023",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あぁ、心配しなくても大丈夫ですよ。\nかわいい生徒に囲まれて、\nムラムラしてしまったことは分かってますから。",
      "jp_sha256": "710617d1970aaafc28ceb2dacd7500f421f0307e8db90752d8050318925f7f77",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아아, 걱정하지 않으셔도 괜찮아요.\n귀여운 학생들에게 둘러싸여,\n욕정해 버렸다는 건 알고 있으니까요.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b622e3f5cd140a37464df873e81c104f067224c42727727932e9a1e631fb9f1c:000002_68175285134775903:g0:r10",
      "row_index_0based": 10,
      "serialized_row_index": 10,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ヴァリナ保険医",
        "Emt4_Enj",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "あぁ、心配しなくても大丈夫ですよ。\nかわいい生徒に囲まれて、\nムラムラしてしまったことは分かってますから。",
        "",
        "ch_66040/R18/66040A0_66040_Nml/66040A0_66040_002",
