    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "8bdc749d8c2b06022a26cd54593a6d9b76507ee7cf44f678993fed36a4d27be6",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "全然分かってないし、どこも大きくなってませんよ！\nちょっと手をケガしたので、消毒して貰おうと思っただけです！",
      "jp_sha256": "6f634270778f73b7b777e9d6da53a4c6accf0b904f0aabb52a5743b06e8820ba",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "전혀 모르고 있고 어디도 커지지 않았거든요!\n손을 조금 다쳐서 소독받으러 온 것뿐이에요!",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 12,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b622e3f5cd140a37464df873e81c104f067224c42727727932e9a1e631fb9f1c:000002_68175285134775903:g0:r11",
      "row_index_0based": 11,
      "serialized_row_index": 11,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "全然分かってないし、どこも大きくなってませんよ！\nちょっと手をケガしたので、消毒して貰おうと思っただけです！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "0c8e3ca1fcf248ae48e0807daf6bd87f9d22611c141464c3b8e0386eed280e16",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "あら、そうだったのですか。\nムラムラして、私に慰めてもらいに来たのだと勘違いしてました。",
      "jp_sha256": "6b89249e76a67a16671fb72745311039847b5287b43470f5d714e5e28efd0ade",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "어머, 그랬나요.\n욕정해서 제게 위로받으러 온 줄로 착각했어요.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 13,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
