      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b622e3f5cd140a37464df873e81c104f067224c42727727932e9a1e631fb9f1c:000002_68175285134775903:g0:r13",
      "row_index_0based": 13,
      "serialized_row_index": 13,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "どんな勘違いですか！\nそれよりもどうなってるんですか、保健室は！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "f452854148c2660ebf7ecc470d3c8abbea83c13f82b68a66ca7f03c9f737d02f",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 6,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "どう、と言いますと？　なにかおかしなところがありましたか？",
