      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "5d1afe637ad67c6f2588b9396c39d2e52b63d5c84cfaff0e4059d226e65d9cf4",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "保健室のドアには「満室」と札がかけられ、\nネオンに輝く看板には「ご休憩は２時間から」と書かれていた。",
      "jp_sha256": "7d2851c51ab702d4354ba7462aaced95de83b329555fcf535ddfc59ccd83804b",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "보건실 문에는 「만실」이라는 팻말이 걸렸고,\n네온으로 빛나는 간판에는 「휴식은 2시간부터」라고 적혀 있었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 19,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b622e3f5cd140a37464df873e81c104f067224c42727727932e9a1e631fb9f1c:000002_68175285134775903:g0:r18",
      "row_index_0based": 18,
      "serialized_row_index": 18,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "保健室のドアには「満室」と札がかけられ、\nネオンに輝く看板には「ご休憩は２時間から」と書かれていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "508122fe9e2dfd110571bdf11b87c1df4ddbe73c396d2c26f3069d42c1991cc9",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "保健室は体調を崩したひと達が利用する場所ですよね！？\nなんなんですか！　「ご休憩」って！",
      "jp_sha256": "8d51f8a7829e4d763859c44c5c0c6929b447e2eee17ab08f3c1389c3107c4a47",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "보건실은 몸이 안 좋은 사람들이 이용하는 곳이잖아요!?\n뭐예요! 「휴식」이라니!",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 20,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "b622e3f5cd140a37464df873e81c104f067224c42727727932e9a1e631fb9f1c:000002_68175285134775903:g0:r19",
      "row_index_0based": 19,
      "serialized_row_index": 19,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "保健室は体調を崩したひと達が利用する場所ですよね！？\nなんなんですか！　「ご休憩」って！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "bebc8347b411fa75e3d66d6f3aea51b912972ca9f4f82faad471d567ce6a94de",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 10,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "「ご休憩」は身体の疲れを癒すことですよ？\n文言としておかしなところはないはずですが？",
      "jp_sha256": "1a98e0686f59e4b212e521b4d7126f86257064c2cd4a84b4d78e27bf03bae5a5",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "「휴식」은 몸의 피로를 푸는 것이잖아요?\n문구로서 이상한 곳은 없을 텐데요?",
      "message_index_0based": 10,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 21,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b011-20261107-ff47d2c5b69e",
